==German==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|de|Heim|chen}}. In the figurative sense popularized by the German title of Charles Dickens' ''{{w|The Cricket on the Hearth}}'' (1845), ''{{w|Das Heimchen am Herde|lang=de}}''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈhaɪ̯mçən/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Heimchen.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n}}

